WEBVTT

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.950
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.300
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.100
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:20.301 --> 00:00:22.601
你：（不挣开）我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
You: (Don't pull away.) I'm the photographer for the party upstairs. What's wrong with your eyes?

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:25.501
摄影师。你是来拍我的订婚仪式的。
Photographer. You came to shoot my engagement.

00:00:25.701 --> 00:00:27.501
眼睛？那是你害的。
The eyes? That's your doing.

00:00:27.757 --> 00:00:31.557
:Luca：Harland把订婚仪式提前了。十分钟后。
:Luca: Harland moved the engagement up. Ten minutes.

00:00:31.757 --> 00:00:36.057
Luca，关掉车库的监控。谁也不许下来。
Luca. Kill the garage cameras. Nobody comes down.

00:00:37.905 --> 00:00:40.205
你：我害的？什么意思？
You: My doing? What do you mean?

00:00:40.305 --> 00:00:45.105
是你的气息。我的双眼只听从它。
It's your scent. My eyes answer to it.

00:00:50.361 --> 00:00:55.161
原来你在这儿。Mate。
There you are. Mate.

00:00:55.509 --> 00:00:57.809
你：和他一起上车
You: Get into the car with him

00:00:57.909 --> 00:01:02.709
很好，上车。
Good. Get in.

00:01:07.465 --> 00:01:12.765
你的气息现在在我身上。每一匹狼都会知道。
Your scent is on me now. Every wolf will know.

00:01:13.113 --> 00:01:15.413
你：那“mate”到底是什么意思？全都告诉我。
You: So what does 'mate' actually mean? Tell me everything.

00:01:15.513 --> 00:01:18.313
Mate。一狼一生。没有什么能凌驾其上。
Mate. One wolf, one lifetime. Nothing outranks it.

00:01:18.513 --> 00:01:20.313
连今晚的订婚也不例外。
Not even tonight's engagement.

00:01:20.569 --> 00:01:22.869
:Selene
:Selene

00:01:23.069 --> 00:01:27.869
让他们来找你吧。
Let them look for you.

00:01:30.717 --> 00:01:33.017
你：一直给你打电话的是谁？是她吗？
You: Who keeps calling you? Is it her?

00:01:33.117 --> 00:01:35.417
Selene。她不是我的。
Selene. She's not mine.

00:01:35.617 --> 00:01:37.917
她一直打个不停。
She won't stop calling.

00:01:41.173 --> 00:01:44.473
那是我的气息。在这里，到处都是。
It's my scent. Here, it's everywhere.

00:01:44.673 --> 00:01:47.973
不是人类。是你们故事里低声传说的存在。
Not human. Something your stories whisper about.

00:01:48.321 --> 00:01:50.621
你：跟着他走进起居室
You: Follow him into the living room

00:01:50.721 --> 00:01:52.521
进来，坐。
Come in. Sit.

00:01:52.721 --> 00:01:55.521
靠近火边待着。
Stay close to the fire.

00:01:57.277 --> 00:02:01.577
闻到你气味的那一刻，我就丢下了它。
I walked out on it the moment I caught your scent.

00:02:01.777 --> 00:02:04.077
Selene 从来不是我的。
Selene was never mine.

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:08.225
你：那是谁？你在等人吗？
You: Who's that? Were you expecting someone?

00:02:08.325 --> 00:02:11.125
没有人。今晚不见。
No one. Not tonight.

00:02:13.381 --> 00:02:16.681
跟紧我。
Stay close to me.

00:02:16.881 --> 00:02:21.181
:Luca：Arkwright小姐，他不见任何人。
:Luca: Miss Arkwright, he's not receiving anyone.

00:02:23.529 --> 00:02:25.829
你：把手按在他的背上
You: Press your hand to his back

00:02:25.929 --> 00:02:30.729
待在我身后。
Stay behind me.

00:02:30.985 --> 00:02:33.285
原来是真的。
So it's true.

00:02:33.485 --> 00:02:37.285
她不用你操心，Selene。
She is not your concern, Selene.

00:02:41.133 --> 00:02:43.433
你：她说的满月是什么意思？看着我。
You: What did she mean by full moon? Look at me.

00:02:43.533 --> 00:02:45.333
看着我。不怕了。很好。
Look at me. Not afraid. Good.

00:02:45.533 --> 00:02:48.333
长老会要你在满月前离开。
The Council wants you gone before the full moon.

00:02:50.089 --> 00:02:54.889
Luca，Alpha。Harland召集了长老。就在今晚。
Luca, Alpha. Harland called the elders. Tonight.

00:02:55.089 --> 00:02:58.389
那他们就会听到我的回答。
Then they'll hear my answer.

00:02:58.737 --> 00:03:01.037
你：牵起他的手，跟他走
You: Take his hand and go with him

00:03:01.137 --> 00:03:05.937
很好，留在我身边。
Good. Stay with me.

00:03:10.193 --> 00:03:13.493
无论他们说什么，你都不许离开我身边。
Whatever they say, you don't leave my side.

00:03:13.693 --> 00:03:15.993
:Harland：带她进来，Magnus。
:Harland: Bring her in, Magnus.

00:03:16.341 --> 00:03:18.641
你：我不害怕。我会留下，但不许再有秘密。
You: I'm not afraid. I'll stay, but no more secrets.

00:03:18.741 --> 00:03:21.041
不会再有秘密了。我保证。
No more secrets. I promise.

00:03:21.241 --> 00:03:23.541
他们要你走。我拒绝。
They want you. I refuse.

00:03:25.297 --> 00:03:28.597
律法比你古老得多。
The law is older than you.

00:03:29.797 --> 00:03:33.597
她是我的Mate。那就这样吧。
She is my Mate. So be it.

00:03:33.945 --> 00:03:36.245
你：接吧。但我要和你一起去。
You: Answer it. But I'm coming with you.

00:03:36.345 --> 00:03:41.145
一起。留在我身边。
Together. Stay beside me.

00:03:42.401 --> 00:03:46.201
她是我的Mate。这就是我的回答。
She is my Mate. This is my answer.

00:03:46.401 --> 00:03:49.701
:Harland：那你就孤身一人了，Magnus。
:Harland: Then you stand alone, Magnus.
